        "ff72739d-90fa-44b3-896f-ca72e4704c77": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<h2>Why Choose the SIHOO DORO-S300 Ergonomic Office Chair?</h2><p>The SIHOO DORO-S300 ergonomic office chair is designed to support the back, shoulders, neck, and posture during extended sitting sessions. Its ergonomic support system adapts to movement and sitting positions while helping reduce pressure during long work hours.</p><p>Key ergonomic features include:</p><ul><li>Adjustable dual dynamic lumbar support<br/></li><li>Breathable premium mesh materials<br/></li><li>Anti-gravity reclining mechanism<br/></li><li>Flexible ergonomic seating adjustments<br/></li><li>Spacious integrated headrest<br/></li><li>6D adjustable armrests<br/></li></ul><p>This ergonomic office chair is suitable for home offices, professional workspaces, gaming setups, and users looking for premium ergonomic seating support.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": true,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
