          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Award-winning design",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_VzndM3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Award-winning design</h3><p>Sihoo Doro S300, a recipient of the esteemed German Design Award, boasts both comfort and visual allure. Crafted from a single piece of aluminium alloy, its main structure undergoes 13 procedures to achieve its aesthetic.</p>",
